<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "10B">
<servcat sctnbr = "10" scnbr = "02">
<configtype typenbr = "0">
<servinfotype sitcode = "0">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0AA200004" svcinfotypenbr = "01" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Precautions for Replacing BCM
</title>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
When replacing the BCM, replace it with new one.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
After BCM is replaced with new one, perform “Immobilizer Key Registration” using SUZUKI scan tool. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0AA206001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
When ECM and/or ISG (K14D model) and BCM are replaced at the same time, refer to 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0AA306003">ECM / ISG Registration</intxref>
 for their registration.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
All of remote controllers must be ready for the registration.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
